# Nothing here. Both __manifest__.py and views/menu_items_override.xml used to
# be ignored, because the deploy copies a per-branch version over them on the
# server. But ignoring them here meant the base version never reached the repo:
# the manifest loads menu_items_override.xml, so any environment without a
# version of its own - main, ehub, a fresh database - installed against a file
# that was not there and brought the whole registry down with it.
